macOS: the keyboard still went dead in fullscreen games (0.7.0-beta.3, 3440x1440). Fullscreen now hides the Dock and the menu bar, which appeared under an RTS's edge scroll and took the activation on a click; every key event of the app reaches the game whatever window AppKit aimed it at (none, or the fullscreen title bar), with Command shortcuts offered to the app menu first and modal alerts left alone; and engine.log names the key window when the game window lost key status, says when it could not be made key again, and names any other app that became active. GEN_FULLSCREEN_MENUBAR=1 keeps the Dock and menu bar.

